  "summary": "Reported: Aisha Khan (HR Generalist, user_id 5) says Outlook has stopped applying her inbox rules that sort mail into folders, starting about a week ago. P3, she can still work. What I checked: account is active, not locked, no failed sign-ins. Mailbox is 24.4% used (12.5 GB of 50 GB), so a full mailbox is not the cause. Device on record: BL-LT-0105. KB search: no article covers inbox rules (closest are KB-009, KB-010, KB-011, and none apply). Still needed: check her mailbox rules on the server side (rules over the size limit, rules that are turned off or broken, client-only rules that need Outlook running, recent changes), find out whether the rules run in Outlook on the web, and fix them.",
